</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>BRIDGESTONE CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA, MASAAKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA MASAAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA, MASAAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An adhesive composition which comprises (A) a thermoplastic high molecular weight polymer having a functional group in its pendant group and having, in its main chain, no carbon-carbon double bondings having a hydrogen at the allyl position thereof, (B) a water-soluble polymer and (C) a compound having a structure obtained by methylene bonding of aromatic groups having a polar functional group, or which comprises (A) the above thermoplastic polymer and (I) a specific aqueous urethane compound, or which comprises(B) the water-soluble polymer and (I) the above aqueous urethane compound. The adhesive composition is used for coating a resin material, for reinforcing a rubber article, and in a rubber member of a pneumatic tire.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Composition adhésive comprenant soit (A) un polymère thermoplastique de haut poids moléculaire, qui contient un groupe fonctionnel dans son groupe libre et dans lequel aucune double liaison carbone-carbone de la chaîne principale ne comporte un hydrogène en position allyle; (B) un polymère hydrosoluble et (C) un composé dont la structure, obtenue par liaison méthylène de groupes aromatiques, renferme un groupe fonctionnel polaire; soit (A) le polymère thermoplastique ci-dessus et (I) un composé uréthane aqueux spécifique; soit (B) le polymère hydrosoluble et (I) le composé uréthane ci-dessus. La composition adhésive peut être utilisée pour revêtir un matériau résine et pour renforcer un article en caoutchouc, ainsi que dans l'élément caoutchouc d'un pneu.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>